1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,500
A colossal gas giant fills the starry void, its atmosphere swirling with indigo and azure bands. A brilliant, thin ring of ice slices diagonally across the blue sphere.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Massive, jagged asteroids drift in the foreground. High above, a tiny spark of light descends towards the planet, trailing a faint tail.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,205
The colony ship plunges down, swallowed by the churning blue clouds.
